<section class="space-y-8">
  <header class="space-y-3">
    <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-blue-700">Personal Project</p>
    <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900">Wake up to only the jobs worth reading.</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">A personal AI job-hunting dashboard I built for myself, now shareable.</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Each day it fetches jobs from multiple sources, scores them against your profile, removes duplicates, sends a digest email, and gives you a clean dashboard to review and apply.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-5 md:p-6 space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">How it works</h2>
    <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-gray-700">
      <li>Set roles and locations.</li>
      <li>Fetch jobs from selected providers.</li>
      <li>AI scores every result against your profile and criteria.</li>
      <li>Review strong matches in your dashboard.</li>
      <li>Apply and track notes and status.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Useful features</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-gray-700">
      <li>Custom roles and location mixes.</li>
      <li>AI prompt tuning for scoring behavior.</li>
      <li>CV-to-job comparison.</li>
      <li>Duplicate detection across providers.</li>
      <li>Applied status and notes tracking.</li>
      <li>Pipeline analytics and run logs.</li>
      <li>Email reports for strong matches.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

